5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The current usage pattern is chaotic. We need data on who actually uses the space.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I worry we are becoming strangers. We need a place for difficult conversations.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I want to know where the hidden hours go. Upkeep eats into our time.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We are paying monthly for a room that fails its primary purpose. I need the figures.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,The noise and mess are the real complaints. I have looked at both.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, the figures will show the cost, but not the usage.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, if we know the hours, we can design for efficiency.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, usage data helps, but I need to see the time cost.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Servas, noise is a symptom. I need the financial symptom.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Jonathan, a quiet space might help, but only if the mess stops.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the tally of use. It shows who dominates the room.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look at where awkward conversations happen. It reveals our social gap.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I will check the round trip for lunch. It shows the time we lose.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the invoices for outside hire. It shows what we already pay.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will check the partition wall. It shows how sound leaks.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
